{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-31","kind":"proposition","title":"过已知点作已知直线的平行线","englishTitle":"Through a given point to draw a straight line parallel to a given straight line.","book":1,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.31/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","contentId":"euclid-1-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c068fe3878afb6cc2662088cf21f1e19f77a05d212fc8cd8b7aab9729386aa3f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-31.statement","euclid-1-31.construction.1","euclid-1-31.construction.2","euclid-1-31.proof.1","euclid-1-31.proof.2","euclid-1-31.conclusion","euclid-1-31.historical.1","euclid-1-31.historical.2","euclid-1-31.historical.3","euclid-1-31.historical.4","euclid-1-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a8a993788f11eb324dea75f9d28e0f77aa6240dbb3db5d5a18c010e52da8b5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Through a given point to draw a straight line parallel to a given straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"通过一个点绘制一条与指定直线平行的直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一点上求作直线与所设直线平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到一个点上的线，使其与已设定的线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f36889b4618a3b3ec3bce53078ec7b31ff138236fecffa970aba07802e0b1658","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be the given point, and BC the given straight line; thus it is required to draw through the point A a straight line parallel to the straight line BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是给定点,让BC是给定的直线;因此,需要从A点划过一条与直线BC平行的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50a7d8f820ddcd8cf04c7c095a303d4ebbef70f2755e20d8bbdbb6fdd77ea0a6","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a point D be taken at random on BC, and let AD be joined; on the straight line DA, and at the point A on it, let the angle DAE be constructed equal to the angle ADC [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]; and let the straight line AF be produced in a straight line with EA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D点随机取BC点,AD点合起来;DA线直线,A点,DAE角等于ADC角;AF线直线延伸至EA线。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99c71af2556b5ae6ebc789c3273b1494d344abeaa52283aa1b60596a7168defa","citations":["euclid-1-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line AD falling on the two straight lines BC, EF has made the alternate angles EAD, ADC equal to one another, therefore EAF is parallel to BC. [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于AD线两条直线相交,BC线,EF线使内错角 EAD,ADC线等同于对方,因此EAF线与BC线平行。 [[I. 27](/principles/euclid-1-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4fe5bece3aeff7476a9ab109a86e97907d0981d79ffe7b6da6ce84ec73d0671","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore through the given point A the straight line EAF has been drawn parallel to the given straight line BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,通过给定点A,EAF直线线与给定直线BC线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e712e1ecf2e02b97d5eb155f01a31d7cbac4fb67e5c86cbe6d027e5dc7093e98","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一点上求作直线与所设直线平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到一个点上的线，使其与已设定的线平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07a27ca326849e046a2ec299c96330eab2af03b16d4ce8fc45077e2b44271fa0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲点上求作直线与乙丙平行先从甲点向乙丙线任指一处作直线为甲丁即乙丙线上成甲丁乙角次于甲点上作一角与甲丁乙等〈本篇〉〈廿三〉为戊甲丁从戊甲线引之至己即己戊与乙丙平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：在点：甲，画一条与 乙丙 平行的直线。首先，从点 甲 画一条直线到线 乙丙 上的任意一点。这是 甲丁，即在 乙丙 线上，在 甲丁乙 处形成一个角。接下来，在点 甲 画一个角，其大小等于 甲丁乙。〈本篇〉〈廿三〉 是 戊甲丁。从线 戊甲 画到 己，即 己戊 与 乙丙 平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bed44ec8aa2bb2cf6949f14ee1f1eabd51d3ee02f98afeef5727ce131161adff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：戊己乙丙两线有甲丁线联之其所作戊甲丁与甲丁乙相对之两内角等即平行线〈本篇廿七〉増从此题生一用法设一角两线求作有法四边形有角与所设角等两两边线与所设线等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：戊己乙丙，两条线由 甲丁 连接。戊甲丁 和 甲丁乙 的两个内角相等，这就是平行线 〈本篇廿七〉。由此问题可知，首先的用法是设置一个角和两条线，找到方法四边形，其中角等于设置的角。两条边线等于设置的线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fbc34a6246c4f11ec3c3e2290e42e35d4ad418799d1d4c59167e78a98da5c6c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：先作己丁戊角与丙等次截丁戊线与甲等己丁线与乙等末依丁戊平行作己庚依己丁平行作庚戊即所求本题用法于甲点求作直线与乙丙平行先作甲丁线次以丁为心任作戊己圜界次用元度以甲为心作庚辛圜界稍长于戊己次取戊己圜界为度于庚辛圜界截取庚辛末自甲至辛作直线各引长之即所求又用法以甲点为心于乙丙线近乙处任指一点作短界线为丁次用元度以丁为心于乙丙上向丙截取一分作短界线为戊次用元度以戊为心向上与甲平处作短界线又用元度以甲为心向甲平处作短界线后两界线交处为己自甲至己作直线各引长之即所求"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下:::首先，画 己丁戊 角和 丙，然后裁剪 丁戊 线和 甲 等，最后画 己丁 线与 乙 平行，然后画 己庚 平行于 己丁，然后画 庚戊。此问题的应用是找到在 甲 点平行于 乙丙 的直线。首先画线顺序 甲丁，以 丁 为中心，以 戊己 为圆周的中心。庚辛 的圆周比 戊己 略长。接下来，以 戊己 的圆周为度数，从 庚辛 的圆上截断。以 甲 的末端为中心，使用 丁 为 戊己 的圆周中心。以 甲 为中心画 庚辛 的圆周，然后取 庚辛 的圆周为中心。庚辛 比 戊己 略长，然后取 戊己 的圆周为度数，并从 庚辛 截断到 庚辛。在 庚辛 的末端，以 甲丁 为中心画 戊己 的圆周。以 甲 为中心画 庚辛 的圆周。接下来，以 戊己 的圆周为度数，从 庚辛 截断到 庚辛。在 庚辛 的末端，以 甲丁 为 戊己 的圆周中心。以 甲 为中心画 庚辛 的圆周。接下来，取 戊己 的圆周为度数并截断 庚辛。在 庚辛 的末端，从 甲 画到 辛 的直线，并画出长度以获得所需值。同时，以 甲 点为中心，在靠近 乙丙 的任意一点，在靠近 乙 的任意点绘制一条短边界线。该点是 丁，使用圆度数，以 丁 为中心，取 乙丙 上方的一部分作为 丙 的短边界线，并以圆度数为中心。以圆度数为中心，以 戊 为中心，在与 甲 平齐的点画一条短边界线，并以圆值为中心。在 甲5 的点水平均画一条短边界线，然后两条边界线的交点是 己。从 甲 画到 己 的直线。画每条线以获得所需值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-31.source","contentId":"euclid-1-31","revisionId":"euclid-1-31@raw-c068fe3878afb6cc","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18fb834b77e0394d0e1c5ad0129bb2bbe9e905cd02c348a0c65a27722f943a7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-31:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-31.construction.2